<Layout title="About GlobalCV"><main id="main" class="content-page article"><span class="eyebrow">A CLEARER WAY TO YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><h1>Your experience deserves to be easy to share.</h1><p class="lead">GlobalCV helps you create or update a resume without a signup wall or a surprise charge at download.</p><h2>Start where you are</h2><p>Begin with a blank resume or import an existing document. Edit your details, choose one of six free templates, and download a text-based PDF. Country guidance covers the USA, UK, UAE, Saudi Arabia and Pakistan.</p><h2>Free to create. Free to download.</h2><p>You can use the core builder without an account. An optional GlobalCV account lets you save private drafts and continue later. Our planned business model is advertising on public guides and template pages, with the editor and exported resume kept free of ads.</p><h2>Your facts come first</h2><p>GlobalCV does not invent achievements, score your chances of employment, or guarantee an ATS result. Our examples are fictional and should be replaced with your own verified information.</p><a href="/builder/" class="button primary">Create your resume →</a></main></Layout>
